{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>益節5合1特強關節配方120粒裝（Move Free 5-in-1 Advanced Formula Plus MSM）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、HKTVmall及Market Place共4間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$82，約23%。</p>\n<h2>益節5合1特強關節配方120粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$278</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$278</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$360</td>\n<td>HK$360</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$371</td>\n<td>HK$371</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$379</td>\n<td>HK$379</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>益節5合1特強關節配方120粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$278，較表列次低標價HK$360少HK$82。這個價差以單盒比較。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月12日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%805%E5%90%881%E7%89%B9%E5%BC%B7%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9120%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/BP_287939\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/move-free-5-in-1-advanced-plus-msm-120pcs/p/592832\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/JJ-MART/s/B1285003/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E9%AA%A8%E9%AA%BC-%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%805%E5%90%881%E7%89%B9%E5%BC%B7%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9120%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/B1285003_S_JK9705\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80%20%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%805%E5%90%881%20120%20PC/i/113756501.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a></p>\n<p>這款配方含葡萄糖胺及軟骨素。美國國家補充及整合健康中心指出，有關兩種成分的關節研究結果並不一致，產品配方亦有差別。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/glucosamine-and-chondroitin-for-osteoarthritis-what-you-need-to-know\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國 NCCIH 葡萄糖胺及軟骨素資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$360－HK$278）÷HK$360×100%計，約23%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441614305879228_7733392126af49e0f902f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"益節5合1特強關節配方120粒裝格價：HKTVmall HK$278，單盒約平23%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441614305879228_7733392126af49e0f902f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到益節5合1特強關節配方120粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月12日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$278。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較每盒120粒、標示5合1及 Plus MSM 的版本。香港商品資料列明葡萄糖胺為甲殼類動物製品。懷孕或哺乳人士請依標籤提示，服用華法林等藥物的人士先問醫生。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:22:06.140842+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":847,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:55:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:29.194741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:23.158719+00:00","content_hash":"f25ad6ee4c7d9ca4cc9fde852c20b294a229bc2c5b2b0417347eef4f4273794c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}